BT 1 0 0 1 0 60.5 Tm /F1 9.5 Tf 14 TL 1.812766 Tw (MySQL is a relational database management system. It stores information in tables made up of rows and) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.984986 Tw (columns. A booking table can represent one booking per row, with columns for the fields required by the) Tj T* 0 Tw .419318 Tw (application. A unique booking identifier is commonly used to distinguish one record from another. The supplied) Tj T* 0 Tw .240718 Tw (report identifies the database as hotel_booking_db; the exact table and column structure should follow the SQL) Tj T* 0 Tw (schema used with the project.) Tj T* ET
